[metadata]
Name=Captain America v5
Description=Captain America v5 (2026-10-11): Captain America v4 upgraded from the bulk binder - better removal (Swords to Plowshares, Lightning Bolt, Force of Negation) and equipment support. Out: Layla Hassan, Stonesplitter Bolt, Abrade, Hookblade, Gold Pan, Ponder, Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior. In: Sword of Forge and Frontier, Steelshaper's Gift, Swords to Plowshares, Lightning Bolt, Force of Negation, Spectacular Spider-Man, Pip-Boy 3000 (Battlefield Improvisation tried first: the AI never cast it).
